`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["The repository's pinned ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/DLR-RM/BlenderProc/blob/76bd8b82ee19489843578ff045298642197bf883/LICENSE",children:"LICENSE"})," is GPL-3.0. This is a code-license observation, not a grant for imported assets, texture datasets or dependencies. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/DLR-RM/BlenderProc/blob/76bd8b82ee19489843578ff045298642197bf883/blenderproc/python/utility/InstallUtility.py#L85-L108",children:"InstallUtility"})," selects Blender 4.2.1 by default; do not merge its behavior with the existing Blender-4.5 manual claims. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/DLR-RM/BlenderProc/blob/76bd8b82ee19489843578ff045298642197bf883/blenderproc/python/utility/DefaultConfig.py",children:"DefaultConfig"})," and ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/DLR-RM/BlenderProc/blob/76bd8b82ee19489843578ff045298642197bf883/setup.py",children:"setup.py"})," expose Blender/Python dependencies, including h5py, OpenCV, SciPy, trimesh and pyrender; the base path needs no learned model checkpoint. A source pin is not a reproducible installed environment, and optional writer routes can add further dependencies."]}),`
