`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["InfiniBench complements BlenderProc capture infrastructure with constraint-driven indoor scenes and task-directed camera search. The paper describes optimizer feedback, movable furniture clusters and object-covering trajectories; the released path needs narrower acceptance claims. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.18200v2",children:"Paper"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["At the inspected revision, generate_indoors wires a compile-only executor: agentic success checks that generated Python produces a cl.Problem, before layout solving. The bundled feedback serializes a BEV path as text. This does not demonstrate the paper's visual optimizer-feedback loop. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/generate_indoors.py#L166-L199",children:"Integration"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/constraints/agentic_framework.py#L400-L426",children:"executor"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/constraints/agentic_framework.py#L124-L182",children:"feedback"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["The two camera implementations differ. TrajectoryOptimizer marks a target visited when no feasible viewpoint is found; its occlusion check is one ray toward the bounding-box center. Batch camera_traj requires all target vertices inside its sampled frustum, but accepts an otherwise admissible candidate when visibility passes the threshold OR the sampling counter reaches max_occlusion_checks. The counter includes rejected samples. Defaults are 0.7 and 40, within a 500-sample budget. A no-path batch segment returns empty while destination rotation poses are still appended. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L780-L812",children:"Simple-camera loop"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L878-L911",children:"ray"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L348-L399",children:"batch sampling"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L408-L456",children:"batch acceptance"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L64-L81",children:"defaults"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L135-L151",children:"no-path return"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/trajectory_optimizer.py#L479-L529",children:"pose assembly"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["QA counting uses object inventory; appearance ordering uses accepted target order. Neither independently verifies first visibility in delivered frames. Proposed GameMap acceptance should retain per-target outcomes, verify rendered visibility and path continuity, and separate missing predictions from scored accuracy. Public source and sample scenes exist; extension-code licensing and reproducible dependencies remain unresolved. ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/qa_from_metadata.py",children:"QA"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/infinigen_examples/run_end_to_end.py#L327-L379",children:"scorer"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://github.com/pittisl/infinibench/blob/d84f0d76d30cd40cc54cfd779fff202399a669b6/README.md",children:"release"}),", ",e.jsx(n.a,{href:"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Haoming645/infinibench/tree/ca5b7999056e5e7e473902294b4826bd6dda536d",children:"dataset"})]}),`
