`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:["FLIP is a materially complementary ",e.jsx(n.strong,{children:"full-reference render-difference diagnostic"}),": viewing-dependent color/edge/point error maps, plus an HDR exposure sweep. It can help compare render candidates against an approved target under a fixed capture contract. It cannot establish that a game action worked, that UI content is correct, or that a temporal artifact is absent. Treat selection based on FLIP as a proposed GameMap fixture, not a result demonstrated by the papers."]}),`
