`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Split candidate development, selection and final evaluation. Reset persistent memory, caches and project copies according to a recorded policy; do not let final-test observations enter later candidate selection."}),`
`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Compare an unchanged harness with one intervention at a time: semantic tools, visual selection, debug views, memory, or generation-in-the-loop. Retain resource budgets, failed attempts and tool errors."}),`
